# sha256 of the `tjs` binary inside each saghul/txiki.js release zip we fetch.
# cli.js (cross-arch/universal builds), setup.sh, setup.ps1 and release.yml
# check downloads against these; cli.js also re-checks its cache on every
# reuse (#26) — the cache is user-writable and whatever sits there gets
# bundled and codesigned.
# Bumping TJS_VERSION: add the new version's lines (the zips' own digests are
# on the GitHub release; hash the extracted tjs, not the zip).
